    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d461">

                <pb facs="0829" n="729" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg729"/>

                <head>No. 461.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1880-01-23"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 23,
                        1880</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 713.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your dispatch No. 1073, of the 18th ultimo,
                    concerning the procedure of the Mexican judicial tribunals of the State of
                    Coahuila in the <pb facs="0830" n="730" xml:id="pg730"/> trial, conviction, and
                    execution of Zeferino Avalos for the murder of another Mexican committed in
                    Texas, was duly received.</p>
                <p>The Department agrees with you as to the value of the precedent thus established
                    under the operation of the Mexican penal code.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <p>WM. M. EVARTS.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
